  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UN Women Landplan Colombia 2024-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Women Strategic note Colombia 2024-2027 - UN Women Colombia 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of UN Women&apos;s Strategic Note (Country Programme) 2025-2028 is to contribute to Colombia&apos;s efforts to address the challenges and opportunities regarding gender inequalities and to strengthen the empowerment of women and girls starting from their participation in peacebuilding, human security, social justice, and social protection, as well as their role as defenders of the environment and their contribution to the acceleration of the Sustainable Development Goals in a context that guarantees their right to a life free of violence.

UN Women will concentrate its work in four of the five pillars prioritized by the UNSCDF signed with the government of Colombia in June 2024:

1) Consolidation of total peace, human security and social justice.

2) Social protection and socioeconomic inclusion, with emphasis on populations in situations of vulnerability, migrants and refugees;

3) Environment, climate action and energy transition; 

4) Enablers of the 2030 Agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta icke-&#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkta st&#xf6;d till UN Women Colombia&#x2019;s Landplan (s.k.&#x201d;Strategic Note&#x201d;) bidrar till att st&#xe4;rka kvinnors politiska och ekonomiska egenmakt och till att skydda kvinnors r&#xe4;tt till ett liv utan v&#xe5;ld, b&#xe5;de inom och utanf&#xf6;r konfliktkontexten, samtidigt som st&#xf6;det bidrar till h&#xe5;llbar fred. UN Women har varit en strategisk partner f&#xf6;r Sverige n&#xe4;r det g&#xe4;ller att fr&#xe4;mja b&#xe5;de j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet och kvinnor, fred och s&#xe4;kerhetsagendan i Colombia i &#xf6;ver 15 &#xe5;r. Denna insats &#xe4;r den andra icke-&#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkta insatsen avtalad mellan Sida och UN Women Colombia (ID 55190037.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This unearmarked support to UN Women Colombia&#x2019;s Strategic Note contributes to the strengthening of women&#x2019;s political and economic empowerment and to protecting women&#x2019;s right to a life free of violence, both within and beyond conflict contexts, while also contributing to sustainable peace. UN Women has been a strategic partner to Sweden in advancing both the gender equality and Women, Peace and Security agendas in Colombia for over 15 years, and this contribution is the second unearmarked contribution signed between Sida and UN Women Colombia (ID 55190037).</narrative>
  </description>
